{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by the flash game 'Strengthening Sword', this game was created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat is the same as the 3D Vampire Survival genre, but other content is point-and-click.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player has nothing but 2000 gold that was initially given.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I recommend you buy a wood sword with that sword, because you have to kill the monster to get the item!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you get the item, you can build a sword that is stronger than a wood sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you make a sword, you can go to the store and sell it. Weapons only, material items cannot be sold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think about how to make gold and survive to the end by monsters for 2 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move Player - WASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attack Key - Q</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move Item - Drag and Drop</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3216310?t=1743509611","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216310/be819741747438af91166d4675258be9dfad6da7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743509611","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216310/cfb5b268ee52e36dac5eb093480429c5b2dfada5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743509611","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216310/cfb5b268ee52e36dac5eb093480429c5b2dfada5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743509611","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by the flash game 'Strengthening Sword', this game was created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat is the same as the 3D Vampire Survival genre, but other content is point-and-click.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player has nothing but 2000 gold that was initially given.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I recommend you buy a wood sword with that sword, because you have to kill the monster to get the item!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you get the item, you can build a sword that is stronger than a wood sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you make a sword, you can go to the store and sell it. Weapons only, material items cannot be sold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think about how to make gold and survive to the end by monsters for 2 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move Player - WASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attack Key - Q</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move Item - Drag and Drop</p>","developers":["Bagilmong"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216310/b4b4dfbfe7f6f283aa2d77f0f1b121234f59fae6/header.jpg?t=1743509611","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257117815,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117815/movie480.mp4?t=1743509609","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117815/movie_max.mp4?t=1743509609"},"name":"Bagilmong","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117815/10b8edc7d86e43d2aef540e07d783ca01821769b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743509609","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117815/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743509609","max":"http://video.akamai.steamsta